```css
.hero__bg { transform: translateY(calc(var(--scroll) * -0.3px)); }   /* parallax */
.card.reveal { animation: slide-in 600ms ease-out both; }

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .hero__bg { transform: none; }                 /* remove decorative motion */
  .card.reveal { animation: fade-in 1ms both; }  /* instant state change */
  html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
}
@keyframes slide-in { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-2rem); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
@keyframes fade-in  { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }
```

| Motion | Under reduce |
|---|---|
| parallax, large slides, zooms. | remove. |
| essential state feedback. | keep, as instant or subtle opacity. |
| auto-playing carousels/video. | pause by default. |

